---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Trip 12 · [Place]">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="back label" href="/stories">All stories</a>
    <div class="head" data-screen-label="Story header">
      <span class="tag">Trip 12 · [Place]</span>
      <h1 class="disp">[Trip story headline]</h1>
      <p class="dek">[Standfirst: where we went and the one moment that made the trip, in a sentence or two.]</p>
      <p class="dek-bn">[বাংলা সারসংক্ষেপ]</p>
      <div class="byline label"><span>[Date]</span><span>Train · Road</span><span>6 friends</span><span>8 min read</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero" data-screen-label="Story hero">
      <div class="frame"><image-slot id="story12-hero" shape="rect" placeholder="Hero photo: the whole group, on location"></image-slot></div>
      <div class="cap"><span>[Caption in sentence case. Who, where, what was happening.]</span><span class="label" style="color:var(--indigo)">Trip 12 · [Place]</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="body" data-screen-label="Story body">
      <article>
        <p>[Opening paragraph. Start with the place and the moment we arrived. Told as we: we went, we got lost, we found the tea stall.]</p>
        <p>[Second paragraph. What we had planned, and what actually happened instead.]</p>
        <figure>
          <div class="frame"><image-slot id="story12-fig1" shape="rect" placeholder="Photo from the journey"></image-slot></div>
          <figcaption><span>[Caption in English.]</span><span class="bn">[বাংলা ক্যাপশন]</span></figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h2>[Section heading]</h2>
        <p>[The middle of the trip. People first: who we met, what they told us, what we ate.]</p>
        <p>[Keep paragraphs short. Bangla words sit in the running text at the same size, like <span class="bn">চা</span>, never a stiff translation.]</p>
        <div class="pull"><p>[A line someone said on the trip.]</p><span class="bn">[বাংলায় একই কথা]</span></div>
        <div class="pair">
          <div class="frame"><image-slot id="story12-pair-a" shape="rect" placeholder="Photo"></image-slot></div>
          <div class="frame"><image-slot id="story12-pair-b" shape="rect" placeholder="Photo"></image-slot></div>
        </div>
        <h2>[Section heading]</h2>
        <p>[The way home, and the thing we'd do differently. Facts and tips go in the box, not here.]</p>
        <p>[Closing line that points to the next trip.]</p>
      </article>
      <aside>
        <dl class="facts">
          <div><dt class="label">Trip</dt><dd>12 · [Place]</dd></div>
          <div><dt class="label">When</dt><dd>[Dates]</dd></div>
          <div><dt class="label">How we got there</dt><dd>[Train from ___, then road]</dd></div>
          <div><dt class="label">Days</dt><dd>[3]</dd></div>
          <div><dt class="label">Who went</dt><dd class="crew"><span>[Name]</span><span>[Name]</span><span>[Name]</span><span>[Name]</span></dd></div>
          <div><dt class="label">Watch</dt><dd><a href="#">The vlog on YouTube</a></dd></div>
        </dl>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="next on-indigo" data-screen-label="Next on the scroll">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="nh"><div><div class="label">The scroll keeps going</div><h2 class="disp">Next on the scroll</h2></div><a href="/stories">All stories</a></div>
      <div class="nstops" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span class="now"></span><span></span></div>
      <div class="ncards">
        <div class="ncard"><a class="ph" href="/story" aria-label="Trip 11 story"><image-slot id="story11-thumb" shape="rect" placeholder="Trip 11 photo"></image-slot></a><span class="tg">Previous · Trip 11 · [Place]</span><h3>[Trip story headline]</h3><a class="lk" href="/story">Read the story</a></div>
        <div class="ncard here"><div class="ph"><image-slot id="story12-thumb" shape="rect" placeholder="Trip 12 photo"></image-slot></div><span class="tg">You're here · Trip 12 · [Place]</span><h3>[Trip story headline]</h3><a class="lk" href="#">Read the story</a></div>
        <div class="ncard soon"><div class="ph"><span>13</span></div><span class="tg">Up next · Trip 13</span><h3>Being planned now</h3><p>Where, when and how we get there is still open. Tell us you're in.</p><a class="btn" href="/join">Join a trip</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .back{display:inline-flex;margin-top:40px;color:var(--indigo)}
  .head{padding:40px 0 48px;max-width:1000px}
  .head h1{font-size:56px;color:var(--indigo);margin:24px 0 20px;text-wrap:balance}
  .head .dek{font-size:22px;line-height:1.45;max-width:36em;text-wrap:pretty}
  .head .dek-bn{font:500 22px/1.45 var(--bn);margin-top:8px;color:var(--indigo)}
  .byline{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 32px;margin-top:32px;color:var(--indigo)}
  .hero .frame{aspect-ratio:16/9;background:var(--paper);border:6px solid var(--indigo);overflow:hidden}
  .hero .cap{margin-top:12px;font-size:16px;color:var(--ink);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,720px) minmax(0,320px);justify-content:space-between;gap:64px;padding:var(--sec) 0}
  .body aside{align-self:start;position:sticky;top:32px}
  .facts{border:6px solid var(--indigo);padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;background:var(--paper)}
  .facts dt{color:var(--indigo)}
  .facts dd{font-size:16px;margin-top:4px}
  article p{margin-bottom:24px;text-wrap:pretty}
  article h2{font:600 36px/1.2 var(--display);color:var(--indigo);margin:56px 0 20px}
  article .bn{font-family:var(--bn);font-weight:500}
  article figure{margin:48px 0}
  article figure .frame{aspect-ratio:4/3;border-width:6px}
  article figcaption{margin-top:12px;font-size:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
  article figcaption .bn{color:var(--indigo)}
  .pull{margin:48px 0;padding:32px 0;border-top:2px solid var(--indigo);border-bottom:2px solid var(--indigo)}
  .pull p{font:800 32px/1.1 var(--display);font-stretch:125%;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--indigo);margin:0}
  .pull .bn{display:block;font:700 28px/1.3 var(--bn);text-transform:none;color:var(--indigo);margin-top:12px}
  .pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px}
  .pair .frame{aspect-ratio:3/4}
  .crew{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
  .crew span{font-size:16px}
  .next{background:var(--indigo);color:var(--cream);padding:var(--sec) 0}
  .next .nh{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:24px;margin-bottom:40px}
  .next .nh .label{color:var(--turmeric-on-indigo)}
  .next h2{font-size:40px;margin-top:16px}
  .next a{color:var(--cream)}
  .next a:hover{color:var(--turmeric-on-indigo)}
  .nstops{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:32px;height:40px;margin-bottom:32px}
  .nstops::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:48px;top:50%;height:4px;margin-top:-2px;background:var(--red-on-indigo);border-radius:2px}
  .nstops::after{content:"";position:absolute;right:0;top:50%;width:10px;height:10px;margin-top:-5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--red-on-indigo);box-shadow:-22px 0 0 var(--red-on-indigo)}
  .nstops span{position:relative;justify-self:center;align-self:center;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;border:4px solid var(--cream);background:var(--indigo)}
  .nstops span.now{background:var(--turmeric-on-indigo)}
  .ncards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:32px}
  .ncard{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
  .ncard .ph{aspect-ratio:4/3;border:6px solid var(--cream);position:relative;transition:border-color .15s}
  .ncard a.ph:hover{border-color:var(--turmeric-on-indigo)}
  .ncard .tg{font:600 14px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--turmeric-on-indigo)}
  .ncard h3{font:600 24px/1.25 var(--display);color:var(--cream)}
  .ncard p{font-size:16px;color:var(--cream)}
  .ncard .lk{font-weight:600;font-size:16px}
  .ncard.here .ph{border-color:var(--turmeric-on-indigo)}
  .ncard.soon .ph{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-style:dashed}
  .ncard.soon .ph span{font:800 64px/1 var(--display);font-stretch:125%;color:var(--cream)}
  .ncard .btn{align-self:flex-start;background:var(--cream);border-color:var(--cream);color:var(--indigo)}
  .ncard .btn:hover{background:var(--turmeric-on-indigo);border-color:var(--turmeric-on-indigo);color:var(--indigo)}
  @media (max-width:1100px){.nstops{display:none}.ncards{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.ncard.here{display:none}.body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);max-width:720px;gap:48px}.body aside{position:static;order:-1}}
  @media (max-width:768px){.head h1{font-size:32px}.head .dek,.head .dek-bn{font-size:18px}article h2{font-size:26px}.pull p{font-size:24px}.pull .bn{font-size:22px}.next h2{font-size:28px}.next .nh{flex-direction:column;align-items:start}.nstops{display:none}.ncards{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:48px}.ncard h3{font-size:20px}.ncard .tg{font-size:12px}}
</style>
